		"name": "Flask user app",
		"description": "Lab 5 - Postman and APIs\nOmar Tabsh - 202400798\n\nTests the Flask + SQLite user management REST API (CRUD). Select the **Flask user app - Local** environment, which defines `baseUrl`. Run the requests in order (or use the Collection Runner): *Add a new user* stores the generated id in `userId`, which the other requests use.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Add a new user",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"type": "text/javascript",
						"exec": [
							"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"const user = pm.response.json();",
							"pm.test(\"Returns the inserted user with a generated user_id\", function () {",
							"    pm.expect(user).to.have.property(\"user_id\");",
							"    pm.expect(user.name).to.eql(JSON.parse(pm.request.body.raw).name);",
							"});",
							"",
							"// save the new id so Get / Update / Delete use it",
							"pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userId\", user.user_id);"
						]
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{
						"key": "Content-Type",
						"value": "application/json"
					}
				],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/add",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"api",
						"users",
						"add"
					]
				},
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Omar Tabsh\",\n    \"email\": \"omar.tabsh@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+961 70 123 456\",\n    \"address\": \"Bliss Street, Hamra, Beirut\",\n    \"country\": \"Lebanon\"\n}",
					"options": {
						"raw": {
							"language": "json"
						}
					}
				},
				"description": "Create a new user record. `user_id` is generated by SQLite and returned in the response. The test script saves it in the `userId` collection variable for the next requests."
			},
			"response": [
